# Ship only what dist/, themes/, media/ and the top-level docs actually need —
# node_modules is fully excluded above (this extension bundles everything it
# needs into dist/extension.js via esbuild, so no runtime node_modules is
# required in the .vsix at all). See the PoC's own .vscodeignore for a
# documented gotcha this repo already hit once: a directory-level exclude
# blocks gitignore-style negation of files inside it, so "exclude all, then
# un-exclude specific files" silently fails — this extension avoids that
# entirely by not needing any node_modules files in the package.
